window.products.push({"id":721047,"name":"Baseball Rose with Graduation Year","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RpDwFy3lL._SL1277_.jpg","description":"Swing for the heart! Congratulate a graduate (or their parents) with a rose that expresses their passion for the game. Each petal of the Baseball Rose is carefully handmade from genuine baseball leather to form an unforgettable bloom that lasts forever. The Baseball Rose requires no watering and will never wilt or die. The artificial stem has a \"life-like\" quality making it difficult to distinguish from live stems when arranged in a mixed bouquet with live roses. Baseball Roses look their best when displayed in a vase arrangement at home, in the office, dorm, or man cave. Create custom bouquets, centerpieces, boutonnieres, and corsages from Baseball Roses with the help of your local professional florist. Hit a Home Run with a Baseball Rose! Each Baseball Rose features: Baseball Rosebud (measures approx. 2\" x 1 3/8\"- actual size may vary slightly) Baseball Rosebud (measures approx. 2\" x 1 3/8\"- actual size may vary slightly) 18\" Stem (measured from bottom of rose bud to bottom of stem) 18\" Stem (measured from bottom of rose bud to bottom of stem) Individually wrapped in a cellophane sleeve Individually wrapped in a cellophane sleeve Total Dimensions: 1 3/8\" x 20\" Total Dimensions: 1 3/8\" x 20\" Assembled by hand in the USA (San Diego, California) from imported supplies Assembled by hand in the USA (San Diego, California) from imported supplies","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RpDwFy3lL._SL1277_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SportsRoses","source_asin":"B07B2FQ3DR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B2FQ3DR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B2FQ3DR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":721048,"name":"4 Rose Gold Rectangle Trays for Elegant Dessert Table Serving Parties 14 x 10 inches (11 x 7 inch serving area) Heavy Duty Disposable Paper Cardboard ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vmFkBo1aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT DESIGN AVAILABLE IN TWO FABULOUS COLORS: These rectangle trays measure by 14 x 10 inches (11 x 7 inch serving area) and are made from premium reinforced 1400g cardboard. Choose from an eye catching gold or rose gold color. YOU EAT WITH YOUR EYE FIRST: And this disposable tableware is going to help elevate your meal. It will take your tablescape to the next level and make any meal look even more scrumptious. Food presentation will be a breeze when you have these buffet dishes. STRONGER AND THICKER THAN OTHER SERVEWARE: Many disposable trays are thin, flimsy and usually a big letdown. Our high end catering tray set stands out from the rest. These platters won’t buckle, bend, or leak when you fill them with veggies, fruit, desserts, and more. PERFECT FOR A WIDE VARIETY OF SPECIAL OCCASIONS: This fancy party tray pack is an excellent choice for breakfast, brunches, lunches, and dinners. Fancy or casual. You’ll use them for Thanksgiving, Christmas, Hanukkah, New Years, Weddings, Birthday and Housewarming Parties, Baby Showers, and more. WE WANT ALL OF OUR CUSTOMERS TO BE HAPPY: If these dinnerware appetizer trays don’t meet expectations (and they will), please let us know. We’ll do everything in our power to makes things right and ensure you’re another satisfied customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vmFkBo1aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yumchikel","source_asin":"B08NTYKBMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NTYKBMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NTYKBMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":721049,"name":"Melange 36-Piece 100% Melamine Dinnerware Set (Hammered Checks Collection) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Plates and Bowls | Color: Lime ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mm3YM-H7L._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn’t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you’ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we’ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you’re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mm3YM-H7L._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B01LF2UKCE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LF2UKCE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LF2UKCE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
