window.products.push({"id":721208,"name":"Breeds Of Chickens tin sign,Vintage Chickens art,Chicken Knowledge Metal Tin Sign Breeds Of Chicken Retro Poster School Farm Cafe Bar Bedroom Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+wbWKk5QL._AC_.jpg","description":"This tin sign is made of tin/metal iron and is brand new. Waterproof and durable, no rust, easy to clean. Printed with beautiful patterns to make fun pewter look more retro and interesting and give it more character.The Metal Sign Perfect For Any Area Or Room, Such As Street,Patio,Garage,Kitchen,Coffee, Bar,home, coffee shop, bar, pub,Club,kitchen,Dinning room,Laundry,Man Cave ,bathroom, Bedroom farm, garden,farmhouse,. No Matter Where It Is, The Metal Tin Sign Will Be The Most Attractive Decoration.Features:The Tin Sign Dimensions: 5.5inchx8inch(14x20cm),8inch x12inch(20x30cm)High-quality environmentally friendly metals sign / plaque.100% recyclable. High-definition picture, durable, rusty, retro trend.It can be easily matched with any space, eye-catching wall decoration, very suitable for home, coffee shop, bar, pub,Club, kitchen, Dinning room, Laundry,Man Cave ,bathroom, Bedroom farm, garden, garage, farmhouse, The Tin Sign Is A Great Gift For Your Friends, Family, Lover Or Yourself on holidays - Housewarming ,Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, Valentine's Day, New Year's Day, Easter Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Birthday, Wedding ectEasy to install: Each tin sign has 4 small round holes on the edge, There is a small round hole in each corners of this painting for easy hanging on the wall with nails or rope, or can be attached from the back of the sign with double-sided tape. Metal tin sign painting is manufactured with folded edges for safety and stability.Pre-drilled corner holes are easy to install on doors, fences, walls (we do not provide screws), indoor and outdoor use.Excellent service: If you have any questions about the product, you can contact us freely. We will reply you asap.PS:(due to the light the color may appear slightly different.Thank you very much for your understanding).Enjoy your shopping and your life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+wbWKk5QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Habilboi","source_asin":"B0BJTHXZHL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJTHXZHL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJTHXZHL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
