window.products.push({"id":721361,"name":"Max & Lily Natural Wood Kid and Toddler Quarter-Round Table, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EI6ldP4jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ultimate space saver, Max & Lily ’s natural-wood quarter-round table fits into a corner and is sized just right for toddlers and young kids aged 3 and older. Coordinating chairs tuck in below the table surface. Max & Lily ’s tables are constructed from solid wood and are quality hardware. Max & Lily ’s furniture does not contain pressed cardboard or other inferior materials. The result is excellent quality that lasts. Max & Lily tables are available in full, half, and quarter round shapes for multiple configurations. Seat kids together for play and pull the tables apart when separation is needed. The quarter-round design is space saving and fits well into smaller kids’ rooms. Max & Lily furniture for kids is designed for fun and function at a reasonable price. Spark independent creativity by allowing kids to set up their own space to draw, learn and store toys and supplies. Made for art, play, meals and more, the table features long-lasting, certified finishes and stains. This durable finish can stand up to vigorous cleanings and play. Measuring 19.75” high and 23.75” in width and depth, the table is fast and easy to assemble. All hardware including a hex-wrench, bolts, and self-stick floor protectors are included. Ready to get out of the nursery and into kid-sized furniture? Max & Lily tables, chairs, stools, and toy storage furniture are perfect for kid’s rooms, family rooms, and playrooms. Max & Lily is the newest member of the Maxwood family of children’s and youth furniture that includes Maxtrix modular kid bedroom furniture, high-style Jackpot bunk beds, and our beautifully designed youth line, Craft Bedrooms. Max & Lily ’s wide range of seating and storage furniture for toddlers and kids can grow with your children and be combined in many different ways to create perfect play, learn and storage solutions for your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EI6ldP4jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Max & Lily","source_asin":"B01MDR4P1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDR4P1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDR4P1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":721362,"name":"Sauder Miscellaneous Storage Storage Cabinet, Silver Sycamore Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jrKj8ntKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Neatly store linens, supplies and more in the Sauder Select two-door storage cabinet. This storage cabinet with doors offers the perfect amount of style and practicality for any room in your home. This durable storage cabinet has four adjustable shelves and a full-width upper shelf so you can stash bins, baskets, blankets, pantry items and more. Finished in a sleek Silver Sycamore and detailed with frame and panel doors and sides, this living room storage furniture is also ideal for the kitchen, basement, garage, utility room, or anywhere you need a storage solution. Store in style with this cabinet with doors from the Sauder Select collection. We hope you like what you see. Sauder designers travel the world and bring back the best and latest in style, finish, and color trends. This inspiring world travel is evident in the cutting edge and innovative furniture solutions we offer to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41jrKj8ntKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B08KLDRNKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KLDRNKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KLDRNKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
