window.products.push({"id":721395,"name":"Kitchen Knife Sharpener, 4 IN 1 knife and Scissors Sharpener, 3-Stage Sharpening System helps Repair, Restore and Polish Blades, Ergonomic Handle, Non","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xwHNbJvWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【BRING YOUR KNIVES BACK TO LIFE】The kitchen knife sharpener is aimed at saving your dulled knives. As you know, even the most expensive knife, you also need to maintain it after long time using and the dulled knives has more risks to hurt people. To save you cooking time, and protect your fingers, you need such a knife sharpener. 【EASY TO USE】3-stage sharpening system for knives plus a honing rod for scissors to entirely repair, restore and polish your damaged blades. Just put the blade in each of the slots ,then pull the knife a few times on one direction for fast, effective sharpening. Your knife will become extraordinary sharp like a new one. 【ERGONOMIC HANDLE & NON-SLIP RUBBER BASE】This knife sharpening tool has ergonomic handle, you can grad it comfortably and tightly; With non-slip rubber base, can stabilize on the counter, assure safe when you sharpen. 【SUITABLE FOR MOST OF KNIVES】 Professional knife sharpener fit for most of kitchen knives except serrated, ceramic blades. Mini size chef knife sharpener won’t take up your limited kitchen space. You will enjoy your cooking time while having sharp knives. 【High quality】A good knife sharpener for long time using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xwHNbJvWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCCC","source_asin":"B07KV8LJ1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KV8LJ1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KV8LJ1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":721396,"name":"Deglon 8-Inch Offset Tomato Knife with Wood Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313ZaF7jTFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Deglon's 8-inch offset tomato knife is simply marvelous. In the 1930's jean Deglon created halfround teeth and his famous bread knife. An idea which started a trend. Thanks to a specific machining process, this knife's blade offers an extraordinary quality of cut and efficiency that is acknowledged throughout the world. It features superior balance, a high quality cutting edge, a black wood handle that's attached to the tang with 2 rivets. It has a long life cutting edge and it's dishwasher safe. Made in thiers, france, the cradle of the french knife making industry. Deglon started making their knives in thiers in 1921 and they're still there. The art of the master cutlery maker has been handed down from one Deglon generation to the next. Their products are meticulously designed and manufactured with the utmost attention to detail and precision. Deglon's utensils are useful, practical, sturdy and innovative. At Deglon, every knife is created with the utmost attention to functionality and detail; Deglon makes precise, beautiful, and reliable tools. They stand behind all of their products. Each knife comes with a life time guarantee against any fault of fabrication (within the bounds of a normal use of the tool).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313ZaF7jTFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deglon","source_asin":"B002CJNCH0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002CJNCH0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002CJNCH0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
