window.products.push({"id":721488,"name":"Unikito Folding Bed with Mattress for Adults, Portable Rollaway Guest Bed, Cot Size Foldable Bed with 5 Inch Memory Foam Mattress and Metal Frame, Rol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UWYboyF0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【Foldable Design & Space-Saving】The folding bed can be folded in simple steps by one person at any time. It measures only a slim 12.8\" thick when you fold it. Designed in a compact size, the portable bed can save space and is easy to store in the corner after folding. Folded dimensions: 31\"W x 11.6\"D x 45\"H - Open Dimensions: 31\"W x 75\"D x 16.9\"H. ✔️【Sturdy & Durable】Build with a high-quality steel frame and reinforced structure, this rollaway bed has good stability and strong load-bearing capacity, bearing a maximum load of 300 lbs. The powder-coated surface features medium rust and scratch resistance for long-term use. ✔️【Memory Foam Mattress & Comfortable】Unikito’s fold up bed is designed with a super soft cozy 5'' memory foam mattress that can reduce stress on the spine and offer you comfort for a good night's sleep! The cover with zippered design can be removed for quick cleaning and maintenance. ✔️【Special Design & Protective】With considerate design, our roll-away-bed adds 2 velcros on the side to ensure the mattress not easily slide when used. Equipped with sturdy buckles, it can effectively prevent the folding bed mattress from suddenly unfolding during transportation. ✔️【Movable & Convenient】This folding bed comes with 4 flexible and smooth caster wheels that allow you to move the bed to any place you want on your own. 360° swivel wheels make it easier to transport or carry. And the lockable function of the wheels confirms the stability when you use it. ✔️【Application & Multi-scene】With a practical design, our foldable bed is suitable for limited space to meet your different needs. It folds and unfolds easily and is great for an unexpected guest, office nap and camping. 💖【Easy Assembly & Reliable】 Coming with detailed instructions and required parts, this roll away bed is easy to set up in several minutes. If you have any questions about assembly or bed, please contact us for support and we will give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UWYboyF0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unikito","source_asin":"B0BKWRYH2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKWRYH2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKWRYH2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
