window.products.push({"id":721662,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake 0.9\" Miniature Christmas Ornament 2021, Nintendo The Legend of Zelda Link, Mini","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tbkrXiIJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring the classic Nintendo \"The Legend of Zelda\" video game to life on your tree with this miniature Christmas ornament. Dimensional pixelated 8-bit styling features the adventurer whose quests in the kingdom of Hyrule have captivated gamers of all ages for decades.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tbkrXiIJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark Keepsake","source_asin":"B09F96KYMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F96KYMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F96KYMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":721663,"name":"Hamilton Beach 40714 Espresso/Cappuccino Maker with Pod Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JWJY4JDHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Bring your coffeehouse favorites home with this espresso- and cappuccino-maker from Hamilton Beach. Add a vanilla twist, mocha, or experiment with new recipes. This no-fuss machine makes it simple—and saves caffeine connoisseurs a few dollars a day. Three buttons control every function, and an easy-fill reservoir allows you to add water any time without turning off the power. Steam nozzle quickly turns milk into fluffy froth. Powerful, 15-bar, Italian pump system extracts cup after cup of rich, café-quality, espresso coffee from your choice of grounds or pods. Includes step-by-step video and recipe card. UL listed. Not sold in Target stores. Amazon.com Enjoy authentic Italian espresso at home with this powerful, 15-bar pump machine. Two stainless-steel filters are included so that either fresh-ground espresso beans or popular pre-measured coffee pods can be used. Two spouts enable two shots of espresso to be made simultaneously; if only one shot is pulled, the cup used must be at least two inches wide to catch both streams at once. Unlike a steam machine, the bar-powered machine can continuously make shots since more water can be added without turning off the power. For cappuccinos and lattes, the steam nozzle heats and froths a small pitcher of milk. Two particularly nice touches: the measuring scoop/tamper device stores in its own covered compartment on top of the machine; and, the substantial drip tray under the metallic-look plastic cup grill completely removes for emptying and cleaning. The 28-ounce transparent water reservoir slides out for filling and cleaning by hand. Measuring 9 by 7-1/2 by 11-3/4 inches, the espresso maker is more compact than many. Clearly marked buttons, red and green lights, an instructional video, and an illustrated user guide make learning to operate this machine a snap. Hamilton Beach covers the espresso maker with a one-year warranty. --Ann Bieri Manufacturer's Notice The U.S. Consumer Product Safety Commission announces the following recall in voluntary cooperation with the firm below. Consumers should stop using recalled products immediately unless otherwise instructed. Name of product: Hamilton Beach Cappuccino Plus Espresso and Cappuccino Makers. Units: 20,160. Manufacturer: Hamilton Beach/Proctor-Silex, Inc., of Glen Allen, Virginia Hazard: Hazard: The steam tube inside the espresso/cappuccino maker can burst under pressure, presenting a risk of injury to consumers. This can occur if the frothing nozzle becomes clogged and the espresso button is pushed while attempting to froth milk. Incidents/Injuries: Hamilton Beach has received 10 reports of burst steam tubes, one of which included a minor burn. Description: The recalled units are Hamilton Beach® Cappuccino Plus™ Espresso and Cappuccino Maker, model 40714. They are black plastic and stainless steel. The Hamilton Beach® brand name is printed on the front of the unit, and the model number is printed on the bottom. Sold at: Internet retailers and discount department stores nationwide from March 2003 through March 2004 for approximately $70. Manufactured in: China Manufacturer Remedy Information Remedy: Hamilton Beach will ship free replacement espresso/cappuccino makers to consumers. Consumer Contact: Hamilton Beach toll-free at (800) 672-5872, Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 8 p.m. (ET), or visit www.hamiltonbeach.com Media Contact: Kirby Kriz, (804) 527-7299. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JWJY4JDHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B00008VNIC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008VNIC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008VNIC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
