window.products.push({"id":721871,"name":"Vegetable Steamer Basket Stainless Steel Steamer Basket Folding Steamer Insert for Veggie Fish Seafood Cooking Expandable to Fit Various Size Pot 5.1\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vgAWpGi1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADE HANDLE DESIGN/EASY to CLEAN – bealy's upgrade veggie steamer basket has a solid telescoping stainless steel handle (height-3.2'' to 6.6''）depending on how much you stretch it. No assembly required, just screw in the handle. The extending T handle helps to insert the steamer basket to even deep pots and keeps your hands away from hot steam. You can rotate to remove the central handle to steam bulky food. The Food steamer is easier to clean and storage than large thin mesh steamer too. DURABLE & SAFETY – Steamer basket stainless steel is made of food contact grade stainless steel to ensure your health, the handle of basket does not break unlike plastic aging to break at high temperatures, the firm handle helps you to remove the steamer from the pot very stably, so it is easier to be removed without slant than handleless steamer. Feet of the steam basket have silicone cover that keep them from scratching the bottoms of pots. Dishwasher safe. EXPANDABLE & FOLDABLE – The vegetable steamer basket stainless steel blades opened between 5.5 to 9 inches, depending on how much you expand it. It is fit for instant pot 3, 5, 6 Quart, pressure cooker, etc. Moreover, the steamer insert can be folded compactly so you can save storage space. HEALTHIER COOKING CHOICE – The small holes on steaming basket are easy steaming and draining. Hot steam goes through the holes cooking the food. Steam cooking your food is a healthy choice, it helps retain more than 90% of the nutrients. It is not only can steam vegetables, such as broccoli, carrots, corn, cauliflower, potatoes, but also can steam meat, crab, seafood, etc. The food steamer basket is also a good choice for baby food steamer. MULTIFUNCTION & GIFT- The steamer baskets is not only as a steamer basket, fruits basket, egg rack, trivet, or strainer, but also a gift for your family and friends who love cooking. You can also use it to filter extra water when making salad too. It comes in a perfect sized box makes it's an awesome gift for your family & friends. For whatever reason, you don't satisfied with this product, just return it and we'll refund. We promise you a satisfactory resolution. Add to cart now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vgAWpGi1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Derebir","source_asin":"B08P8R8QPP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P8R8QPP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P8R8QPP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
