window.products.push({"id":721876,"name":"Sundu Pro Steam Station with Ceramic Soleplate, 1800W Steam Station Iron for Clothes with 1.5L Removable Water Tank, Iron Lock for Easy Carry, Auto Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zP+8P8CpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1800-Watts Steam Station - Sundu steam station can let you easily glide across various garments and smooth hard-to-reach areas and select the ideal steam output and heating temperature to iron a variety of materials such as wool, knit, silk, linen, polyester, nylon and cotton. The continuous powerful steam output tackles even the toughest clothing wrinkles. Double-layer Ceramic Soleplate - With a premium double-layer ceramic soleplate, the steam station iron provides optimum heat distribution and maximum steam penetration for a smooth ironing experience. Super anti-scratch, more durable and safer, and easier to clean and glide. Auto Shut-off & LED Display - This safety feature ensures the Pro steam station is turned off automatically after 10 minutes, avoiding accidents and burnt clothes. With the Led display you can clearly know the temperature level (ECO, Max) and water shortage protection. The self-cleaning feature can expel water scales and other debris. ANTI-CALC prevents mineral build-up. 1.5L/50.72oz Removable Water Tank: Large detachable large capacity water tank design allows for longer periods of ironing without refills and is suitable for large family populations, hotels, clothing stores, etc. Equipped with a measuring cup, it provides for easy refills and endless ironing sessions. Easy to Carry and Storage: Easy and safe lock system makes it easy to move the iron from place to place. This feature locks the iron to its base, keeping you safe. What's more, the steam cord storage gives you maximum convenience. NOT A USED ITEM: All Sudnu irons are tested with water after production, this is to ensure that you get your hands on the product can be used normally, there will be water residue in the water tank after the test, please rest assured that this is a normal phenomenon, not a used product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zP+8P8CpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sundu","source_asin":"B0C4SMDZN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4SMDZN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4SMDZN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
