window.products.push({"id":721970,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Symposium Cocktail Glass, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713JZo1dbcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bormioli Rocco's first glassware factory dates back to 1825, but historians say the origins of Bormioli Rocco glass can be traced back to the Middle Ages. Through many technological and financial investments over the years, Bormioli Rocco has grown from a single company into a group of companies and multinational production units. Present in Europe and the United States, Bormioli Rocco continues to expand as a brand leader in the Home and Restaurant market. The Symposium Collection is a complete new collection of stemware and tumblers for professional beverage services. A perfect balance of refined elegance, inspired shapes and versatility, for a line that adds a touch of seduction to every table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713JZo1dbcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B001J54X9E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001J54X9E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001J54X9E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":721971,"name":"Holiware - Fun Holiday Dinnerware Set of 2 Ceramic Red Star Shaped Dishes Service Candy/Dessert/Plates/Dishes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ebnvJ5gL._AC_SL1427_.jpg","description":"When hosting a party or just setting your dinner table, be the one to impress your family and friends when entertaining with this unique Star Shaped Dishes available in sets of red or green. These high quality stoneware star shaped dishes are an original addition to your party or dinner Décor. These dishes match and mix well with other colors and complement all different styles of table and décor. Some of the versatile uses for this product include but not limited to: Party Dinner Preparation From oven to table – bake some delectables in this original Star Designed Dish. Freezer safe – create and freeze frozen desserts with these adaptable dishes. Dinner and Party Table Adornment Add some fun and creativity with these unique Star Shaped and Colored Dishes to your table décor. Lay them flat for candy, dessert or pie use. Use as Chargers. Throw them around for some added sparkle and depth to your table. These dishes are a beautiful and elegant addition to any type of Dinner Décor. Holiday Decorations ‘Tis the season to decorate and celebrate! These Star Shaped Dishes with their intricate design and smooth surface are a must have for your Holiday Décor. Purchase these star shaped dishes to enhance the top of your fireplace mantel, countertops, or use them in your hutch and cupboards. Just pop them on a stand and enjoy their beautiful addition to your party decorations and celebrations. Great Gift Idea The star shaped fun tableware set is the perfect gift idea to your mom, friend, co-worker, wife etc. This is a quality and unique gift they will enjoy for many years to come. Highlights High Quality Stoneware Lightweight for easy handling BPA Free Microwave/Oven and Freezer safe Due to its unique star shape and color its best if hand washed Useful for dinners/parties/camping/decorating","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ebnvJ5gL._AC_SL1427_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HoliWare Inc","source_asin":"B076NDR28M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-721971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076NDR28M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076NDR28M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
